<title>USA: Numeric to close growth fund at $100 mln assets.</title>
<headline>Numeric to close growth fund at $100 mln assets.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Numeric Investors said it will close its growth fund when it tops $100 million in assets.</p>
<p>Numeric said the fund has hit $80 million in assets recently.</p>
<p>It also plans to close the microcap and growth and value funds when they hit the $100 million level.</p>
<p>The microcap fund has assets of about $56 million, while growth and value has assets of $29 million.</p>
</text>
